          "quote": "后续我们可以根据您打药后的血糖变化再调整方案。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The model did not provide a near-term follow-up with a responsible service, specific timing, or materials to bring; only a vague future adjustment promise.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
